# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Git commits listed here are skipped by `git blame` and the GitHub
# blame UI. Use ONLY for purely mechanical, repo-wide reformatting
# commits — never for behavioural changes.
#
# How to use locally:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub honours this file automatically when present at the repo root.
#
# Format: one full 40-char commit SHA per line. Inline `# comment` is
# allowed after the SHA.

